{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、風が強いせいか、\n雲の流れが早かったなあ＾＾＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/28/photo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間もこんなふうに、\nふわふわ、風に流されて\n何処かに行ってしまうのかな○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまでクリスマスだったのに\nもう年末なんですね( ´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は、激動の1年でしたっ(`･ω･´)\nまさに、180度ってこのこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの夏休みまで、\n吹奏楽で高校野球の応援をしてて\n部活や勉強に一所懸命だった私が、\n夏休み終わったら、もう\n世界が変わってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれから、時間の流れが早すぎて\nふわふわ浮かぶ雲みたいに、\n全然つかめないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年の子はみんな冬休みを\n満喫しているのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いけど、楽しんでほしいな  ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の青春時代は、\n皆さんに捧げます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ！今日もいい夢\n見れますように(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お休みなさい◎°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽只今、質問をノートに書いて\nまとめてるので、次回\n質問返し致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと待っててね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}